WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:08.940
Change the rent, add a unit or extend the term with an addendum, preview it, then apply it.

2
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:15.800
A lease is never edited directly once it is active. Changes are made with an addendum.

3
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:24.790
On the lease, find Addenda and choose New addendum.

4
00:00:24.790 --> 00:00:31.070
The addendum takes effect from this date; earlier invoices stay as they are.

5
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:35.920
Write why the lease is changing.

6
00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:39.010
Enter the new rent per square metre.

7
00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:44.020
Add a unit, or tick a unit to give back.

8
00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:48.120
You can also extend the term in the same addendum.

9
00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:51.620
Choose Preview the addendum.

10
00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:58.420
The draft lists every change: the new rent, the unit added and the longer term.

11
00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:05.910
It also shows the invoices that will be voided, and the new ones issued in their place.

12
00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:13.150
Upload the signed addendum, then choose Apply the addendum. The old invoices stay in the history.
